Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第十九集 零工
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go along the top now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在沿着顶部放 灯带会自己呈现波浪状
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This one will probably go back on itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready? - You don't need to throw it, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 准备好了吗? - 你不需要扔 我够得到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I have to swing it. - Yeah, I know this, but I'm tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 不过我得晃一晃灯带 - 我其实挺高的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a big day, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天是个大日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many tractors? - A hundred tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有多少辆拖拉机? - 一百辆拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A hundred tractors? - A hundred tractors, all for charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一百辆拖拉机?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一百辆拖拉机 慈善游行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you go under the sunroof, or?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是要放到天窗下面还是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, not through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不用通过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd much rather do this with my friends, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我更想跟我朋友挂灯串 而不是和你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Everyone heard that, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家都听到了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did everyone hear that Christmas good cheer from Kaleb Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家都听到卡莱布库珀的 圣诞欢呼了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need a cable tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要扎带
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:01:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've never known how they work. I'd be a useless policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:01:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直搞不清楚扎带是怎么用的 幸好我平时也用不着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go. - That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 - 这就行了?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I could be a policeman. - Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会用了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:09.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Say the thing. I did a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说吧 完整地说出来 “你完成了任务”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我完成了任务
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I wish you a hopeful Christmas ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I wish you a brave new year ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ All anguish, pain and sadness ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:49.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Leave your heart And let your road be clear ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ They said there'd be snow at Christmas ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ They said there'll be peace on earth ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Hallelujah, Noel be it heaven or hell ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ The Christmas we get we deserve ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The annual Christmas tractor run
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一年一度的圣诞拖拉机游行 宣告圣诞庆祝活动拉开了帷幕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}heralded the start of the Yuletide festivities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as everyone settled down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当每个人都穿着时髦的新毛衣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in front of the Boxing Day telly in their snazzy new jumpers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在节礼日当天坐在电视机前时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我却没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Normally I'd be thinking about: "Which party shall I go to this evening?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}通常情况下 我会考虑今晚去参加哪场派对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Where shall I go tomorrow lunch time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明天午餐去哪里吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All I'm doing now is thinking: "Have the pigs got water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我现在却一直在想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Have the cows got hay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“猪猪们有水吗? 奶牛们有干草吗?”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning pigs. Ready for some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 猪猪们 在等吃的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Big dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on. Out you go. Out you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 你们下车吧 下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Feeling peckish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}饿了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready, steady, and over she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备 站稳 跨过去!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oi! Move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 退后 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Give you a bit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dog get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狗狗!出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, heel, heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎!过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How have you got in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么进来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How did they get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们怎么进来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's Christmas time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on weaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 小猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on weaners. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快来 小猪猪 过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Food time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该吃饭了 艾莉亚!珊莎!过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya, Sansa, heel, heel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come out, dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出来 狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
