Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to know how they can both do that, but they won't jump into the Range Rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想知道它们俩为什么能跳进来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}却不肯跳进路虎揽胜的后备箱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on Sansa, in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 珊莎 进去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 进去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎 进
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are such a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, while Christmas was busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 尽管圣诞节非常忙碌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did manage to get away for a week in the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还是在新年时离开了一周时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, piggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好 猪猪们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when I returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我回来时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}pig-sitter Kaleb had some surprising news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}养猪人卡莱布带来了 一些令人惊讶的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How was holiday? Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 假期过得怎么样? - 很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How have the pigs been?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪猪们怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah... It's been an interesting experience
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在你不在的时候照顾猪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}looking after them while you've been away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是一段有趣的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - We've got five piglets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有了五只小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:04.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - We've got five little piglets!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:04.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 我们有了五只小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Piglets? - Yeah, piglets, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 小猪崽? - 是的 小猪崽 五只
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All doing really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How's that happened? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这怎么可能? - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They only got mated...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们一个月前...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did they? Well, you-- - A month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你... - ...才交配
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So she was pregnant when I bought her. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我买它时 它已经怀崽了 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They were sold as empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们却把它当没怀孕的猪卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you've had a deal and a half then
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你可算是捡了大便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}cos you've got five little piglets that you didn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为在你不知情的情况下 你有了五只小猪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, they're adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're cute, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们很可爱 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done, mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 猪妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're better than sheep. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们比羊好 对吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your mother's really not bothered, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你妈妈真的一点都不在乎 对吧? 看看它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As they had sticky up ears,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们的耳朵是竖起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was quickly obvious the father hadn't been a pedigree Sandy and Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 显而易见 它们的父亲并非纯种牛津桑迪黑猪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But whoever he was,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但不管是谁 它都生出了非常棒的后代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he'd produced some very brilliant offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you want me to put him back down?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 要我把它放回去吗? - 它们要在窝里住多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they live in there for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'll be in there for another...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们还会再住一个...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll move them into the other place, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要让它们 搬到另一个地方 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got to get them out of your field, and into the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须把它们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 从你的地里赶到树林里去 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I do want to get them out of this field,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我确实想带它们离开这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it's bleak for them up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为对它们来说 这里太荒凉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at the really small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看真正的小家伙 它真的很小
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She is properly little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你抱住它了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the micro pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这只迷你猪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像是暖...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's always a runt. - Oh, but she's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}任何物种都有小不点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它就...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the little nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看它的小鼻子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like the proud parents. Smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们像骄傲的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Proud parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 笑一个 - 骄傲的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Proud parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}骄傲的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, this happy moment was short-lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}遗憾的是 快乐的时光总是很短暂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the next day, little runt piggy went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为第二天 小不点就失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you don't want to know what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你们不想知道到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}put your fingers in your ears now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那立刻捂住耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just find it incredible that a pig won't eat an onion,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是觉得很不可思议 猪连洋葱都不吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- but it will eat its own child. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但它竟然会吃掉自己的孩子 - 就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The only thing they don't eat is teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们唯一不吃的是牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- but they won't have had teeth. - There's no teeth in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但它们不吃牙齿 - 那儿没看到有牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There's just the bit of an ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只剩下了一只耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's all there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就只有耳朵 因此我才知道它被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's how I know it was eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My first thought was it's been taken by a Red Kite, a Buzzard or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一开始以为 它被红鸢或秃鹰什么的叼走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but there's no way it could have got into the pigloo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但那些动物没法进入猪窝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was poorly anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它本来身体就不好 太难过了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just hope it was dead before she ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只希望它在被猪妈妈吃掉前就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For now, though, we'd have to put the pig cannibalism to one side,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在 我们必须 暂时搁置猪吃猪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because if Kaleb was right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为卡莱布没说错 一场小猪崽海啸即将袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and a piglet tsunami was on its way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd have to get their new home built in the woods sharpish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须快速地 在树林里给它们建新家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna have this fence here. It's gonna have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要在这里建围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a gate there, gate there, gate there, that's 80 metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要在那里、那里还有那儿装上门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 80米 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, this one gate accesses that and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这扇门可以通往那里和那里 而这扇门则通往那边和那边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one does that and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put a new fence along there and up, which is easily done, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}沿着这里修建一道新围栏 然后往上延伸 这很容易吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so we'll measure 80 metres, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 所以我得测量80米 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's perfect, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很完美吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Gerald can keep an eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德可以帮忙看着它们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Gerald, your lovely woodland view. - Nice south-westerly blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰拉德 你可爱的林地景色 - 好一阵西南风呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because Gerald's house is not very far away through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为杰拉德只... 杰拉德的房子离那边不远
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's going to have some pig honks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他会听到猪叫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh bless him. Hey actually, talking of Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}祝福他吧 对了 说起杰拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He had his op, didn't he? - Yeah, he had his op three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他做了手术 不是吗? - 是的 他做了手术 就在三天前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, I rang... - You talked to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我给他打过电话了 - 你跟他聊过?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. I spoke to him two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我两天前跟他聊过 我要给他带点猪肉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm going to take him some pork. - Oh good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他想要五花肉 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He wants some belly pork, so he must be feeling a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他肯定感觉好些了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And apparently... - He seems happier now actually as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 显然... - 他现在似乎更高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, the word is he's on the mend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 据说他正在逐渐康复
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what we like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就喜欢听这话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a few walls fell down, so we need him to be back at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有几堵墙倒了 所以他得回来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, we do want him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我们确实希望他回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the plans agreed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:09:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}计划达成一致后 我们必须开始修剪头顶上方的树枝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:09:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to start by trimming the overhead branches
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so they wouldn't get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样它们就不会妨碍我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And because this is a TV show,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后因为这是一档电视节目 那意味着有诸多健康和安全措施
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that meant plenty of fuss from Health and Safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Jesus, got him manhandling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 天啊 你动作太粗暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then to make sure you can't escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 确保你无法逃脱...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't do this. Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我做不到 把它拿掉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - I can't have it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 我没法戴着这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't not have it on because we're being filmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须戴着 因为我们在拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are we ready? Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗?看起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you manage, Lisa? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能行吗 丽莎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们弄好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}弄好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:09:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit! You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:09:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟了 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's okay, I'll get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事 我会救你出去 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You all right? No, he forgot he was attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事 他忘了他还拴着绳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You forgot you were tethered. Just come back a little bit, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 该死 你忘了自己被拴着吗? - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you hit your head? Just come back a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你的头受伤了吗? - 回来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need you down a little bit further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我需要你再往下一点 - 我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's alright, I'll do it. Just step up a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 再回来一步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So let's be brutally honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们实话实说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Health and Safety equipment has injured him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是健康和安全设备伤了他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got a bruise coming up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里快出现淤青了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did exactly the same thing, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我遇到过一样的情况 记得吗? - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you did it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 你也遇到过 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got to get rid of all Health and Safety equipment off the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们必须
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:30.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really injuring people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把农场上所有健康和安全设备都移走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是害人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Luckily, Kaleb's skull was thicker than the cage it had hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 卡莱布的头骨 比他撞上的笼子还硬
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so work continued.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以工作继续
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Keep going, keep going, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come up to me a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再过来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, while building the new pig houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 在修建新猪舍的过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was reminded that the woods were in urgent need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想起了树林急需维护
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:10:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of some maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the main job, as I'd discovered back in the autumn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而正如我在秋天时发现的那样 主要的工作是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was repairing a rapidly collapsing dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}修缮一座迅速崩塌的堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is supposed to all be filled with gravel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这本来应该全部填满砂砾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the gravel has all been washed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但砂砾全都被冲走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There should be five railway sleepers there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里应该有五块铁轨枕木
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then the water goes into the pipe and comes out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 水应该进入管道 然后从那里出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I don't mend this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我不修好堤坝 下次再下雨的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when the rains start again,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this will all be washed away, and the pond will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一切都会被冲走 池塘就会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There'll be nowhere for the trout or the kingfishers that live here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生活在这里的鳟鱼或翠鸟 还有住在这里的鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the ducks that live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都将无处可去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got to mend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得把它修好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, I was now wise enough to know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 我现在很聪明地知道 在充满老鼠和田鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that before doing anything like this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in a wooded environment full of mice and voles,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}且树木茂盛的环境中 做任何事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd need to consult with mister "No No No" himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都需要咨询一下 “不不不”先生本人的意见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 早上好 汤姆 - 早上好 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, Jeremy. - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗? - 我很好 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm all right. Good to see you. - You as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我也是 怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What er... Dogs, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狗狗 过来 跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm training them. Hang on, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正在训练它们 等等 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I understand that you have some plans
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你有一些计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to do some works around... Heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 想在这个小池塘周围... - 跟上!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}|Tom] ...this rather fetching little pond down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...做一些工作 - 别
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, Arya, heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎、艾莉亚 跟上!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you planning to come down here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是打算来这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My plan is... Okay, here's what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的计划是...好吧 我打算这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just want to be able to get along here cos I've got to be able to mend that dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想好好开发这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我必须修补堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. All right. - Which, as you can see, is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 没错 - 如你所见 堤坝坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Predictably, Tom's red flags
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不出所料 汤姆开始大量插红旗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}were already out in force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've got some previous kind of evidence here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你之前有一些证据表明 这里有小龙虾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of having some crayfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think there's loads in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得这里有很多 - 在这池塘里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm. - American ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}美国小龙虾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah. North American signal, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 北美小龙虾 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they're the bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们是有害物种 - 它们是有害物种 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They are the bad ones, yeah. - That have killed all our English ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们会害死英国小龙虾 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They're the grey squirrels of crayfish. - Yeah effectively. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是小龙虾界的灰松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that right? - But they're nastier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 的确 没错 - 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们更烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How big are they? I've never seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们有多大?我从没见过 - 差不多有16到18厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}16 to 18 centimetres, like the bigger males.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 较大的雄性的话 - 换算成英制单位呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What's that in English? - Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Six inches? - Basically about this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 六英吋... - 它们能长到这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, they're like lobsters? - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像龙虾一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're going to see the aggressive males first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你会首先看到有攻击性的雄性
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How aggressive are they? - They eat their own young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有多大的攻击性? - 超级大 它们会吃掉小的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, lot of that going on at the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 最近发现很多物种都吃幼子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I've been told there are crayfish in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我听说这里有小龙虾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I was going to catch them and then sell them in the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来想抓住它们 然后在商店出售
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you can't do that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Prison sentences?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会被判刑吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.28,0:13:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, there's prison sentences to that, and a fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.28,0:13:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 这种行为会被判入狱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - I think it's about £2,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还得缴纳罚款 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好像是2500英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£2,000? So if I were to catch one of these crayfish
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 两千... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我抓住一只小龙虾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- then I could be fined £2,500. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那我就要被罚2500英镑 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Potentially a prison term as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也可能被判入狱 - 有可能入狱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And possible prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Possible, possible prison, of course. - Depending on the scale of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 取决于情节的严重性 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Another problem you have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is I can see some evidence that some of the banks have eroded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以看到一些堤坝被侵蚀的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's the biggest kind of issue. - Ooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是最大的问题 - 它们在吃堤坝!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are they eating the banks? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 随着这些小龙虾深入堤坝...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With these crayfish burrowing into these banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}cos they can burrow about 2 metres at water level back in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们可以挖到 水下约两米深的地方 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then it can be quite a complex set of burrows that they've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 那儿可能有一组相当复杂的洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you're going to bring machinery down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果你要带机器过来... - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you need to be really careful how close you get to some of these banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...你得非常小心地靠近这些堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- because they might just give way. - In case I squash an invasive crayfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么?以防万一 我压扁入侵的小龙虾?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No cos you might end up with your machinery in the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可能会让机械掉进湖里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- which we don't want, so... - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可不想这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd be highly cautious about doing anything around these banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我在堤坝周围做事时 会非常谨慎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How would you recommend I did this work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你建议我怎么完成这项工作呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My preference would be that a lot of this would be more manual
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我更倾向于
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}than heavy machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人工完成修缮工作 而不采用重型机械
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's the safest way of doing it. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不... - 这么做最安全
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With Tom's advice about not using heavy machinery taken onboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听取了汤姆不使用重型机械的建议后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I set to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:14:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ahooya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:14:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let me talk you through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我给你们讲讲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Italian made, low centre of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是意大利制造的 低重心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Top speed: 4 km/h.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最高时速达每小时四公里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's twice as fast as a snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比蜗牛快两倍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Speed, though, was not its party trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然速度不是它的特长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, what Wally the radio-controlled robo-mulcher does best
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 无线电遥控割草机器人瓦利 最擅长的是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is clear away absolutely everything in its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}清除其路径上的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy Moly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What manner of thing is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这玩意也太给力了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hellfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a destroyer of worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是世界的毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They could have had HS2 built in about 20 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要是当初有这机器 高速铁路二号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if they'd had one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}应该20分钟就建好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't even see what it's doing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我甚至看不清它在里面干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a whole new game, this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一个全新的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you can't see where it's gone, you just only use sound
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当你看不到它去哪儿的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to hear what it's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你只需要靠声音来听它在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shitting hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哎呀!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've broken the one bit of dam that remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我破坏了仅存的一点堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 尽管我对那里造成了 可怕的伤害 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}despite the terrible damage I've caused over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have-- Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Blinded myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}戳到我眼睛了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But apart from the light blinding and the damaged dam,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但除了眼睛被戳了一下和堤坝受损外
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have finally, after two or three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经过两三年的努力后 我终于再次打通了这座堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}opened up this dam again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we can effect a repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样 我们就可以进行修缮了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb then joined me to get the ball rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随后 卡莱布跟我一起开始修缮工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, to begin with,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}起初 一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}everything went swimmingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We dug through the subsoil
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们挖掘了下层土
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to get to the farm's seemingly limitless supply of waterproof clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挖出了农场里 似乎取之不尽的防水黏土...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Juicy clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}湿漉漉的黏土
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which we'd use to create the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我们会用它来建造堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续 继续放
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then took the old pipe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们将旧管道取了出来...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gravity, easy transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多亏了重力 轻松运输
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And manoeuvred the new pipe into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...并将新管道安装到位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Keep going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续朝那边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah! Look at that! - That's bang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看看! - 刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:18:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But from that moment on, the arguing started,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:18:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但从那一刻起 争论开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because when it came to dam building,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为当谈及修建堤坝时 我们俩都是行家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we both knew best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You see how it's sat in the channel. We've just got to fill clay in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看管道放在凹槽的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我们只需要 往里面填充一些黏土就行 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you're going to have to lift this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 你必须把管道抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but it isn't just a little bit. It's a precise measurement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且不是只抬一点点 这需要精确的测量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got to lift this up with the clay. We can do that by hand, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只需用黏土把它稍微抬高一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. - And then bed it with clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但我们可以手动完成 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, but you say a little bit, but not like a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 给它铺上黏土
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但你说一点 但...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm talking about that much higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们可以手动完成 - 不是一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的意思是要抬这么高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I won't be that much. - It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不用那么多 - 需要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I reckon that much. - No, that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得要这么多 - 不 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When we get the right height, Kaleb...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们达到合适的高度时... - 说实话 把它开出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Honestly, take that out. - Shush. Please, listen. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你别说话了 请你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The bottom of this has to be an inch below the level of the overflow pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的底部必须比溢流管低2.5厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对!我知道该怎么做 但你一直不让我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know how to do it, but you just keep shutting me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To settle the dispute,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了解决争端 我们安装了激光测量器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we installed a laser measuring device.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那以后 我们开始建造临时堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we started building a temporary dam
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:19:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to create a dry working area for the proper dam,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:19:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为真正的水坝打造一个干燥的工作区
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is when the squabbling got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而就在那时 争吵更激烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leave those. We're going to need them to build on top of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 求你了 你别碰 我们需要它们作为坝基
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but we're going to do it there, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我们要放在那里 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Please, stop interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 请别动 别再干涉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So sensitive all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一直那么敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many more do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还需要多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't touch the laser... Don't touch the laser thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别碰到激光器 别碰到激光测量器!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God strewth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好家伙 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no! He's done it. Don't hit the laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不...别撞到激光器!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh for fuck's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真烦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've never seen incompetence like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我从没见过这么没用的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why didn't I do... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我为什么没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Can you put it on crab steer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好吧 你能调到四轮同向转向吗? - 可以
