Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会让车轮都朝一个方向转动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
