Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你没用四轮同向转向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, Kaleb, stop it! You've got to get it in crab steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 卡莱布 停 你得用四轮同向转向
