Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's in crab steer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是四轮同向转向 但我没法转动方向盘 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I cannot turn the steering wheel.
