Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's in crab steer! I just cannot move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是四轮同向转向 我只是没法动...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you have to turn the steering wheel to lock it into crab steer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你必须转动方向盘 才能把它锁定到四轮同向转向
