Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're going to have to get a chainsaw and lop that branch off.
