Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You idiot! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're meant to cut from the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么了? - 你得从底部开始锯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去你的!
