Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道会发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That wasn't funny. I told you...
