Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我他妈的什么都没做 你要从底部锯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You spent all morning throwing fucking rocks at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你整个早上都在跟我作对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now...
