Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:21:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}树落到我头上了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, what's going on?
