Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah well, now I can explain that, and you'll be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我可以解释一下 你会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}瞧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're repairing the dam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们在修缮堤坝吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The pipe that was in there was all broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}里面的管道全都坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've got that out, we've got some clay
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把那个弄出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to create a temporary dam
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在建造真正的堤坝时 我们拿黏土搭建了一个临时堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}while we build the proper dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. - But then the foetus,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 但然后 这位巨婴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whose only been driving for a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只开了几分钟车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}has managed to drop the telehandler off the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就成功让伸缩臂叉车脱轨了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 那...就那样...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then he went against a tree branch, which I had to cut off,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后他撞到了一根树枝 我不得不把它锯掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and he thought it would be humorous if I was cutting near the knuckle,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而他觉得我从关节处开始锯很可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause he could see from the cab
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他能从驾驶室看到 这样用电锯锯树枝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that it would push it round and knock me over
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:23:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会让树枝落下撞到我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with a running chainsaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's untrue. - Yes, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那不是真的 - 他觉得...这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's not. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 不是 - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You were using a chainsaw? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你用了电锯? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.24,0:23:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like that? Well, I had a hat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.24,0:23:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就这么用的? - 我戴着帽子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Safety trousers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安全裤呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My jeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我穿了牛仔裤 - 你可能会锯到腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You could have cut your leg off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly, but I wouldn't have done if it weren't for Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 确实可能
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果不是卡莱布 我不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to seriously reprimand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须严肃斥责他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, no, I'm reprimanding you for not wearing any...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我知道 我在斥责你不穿...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was wearing, I had a visor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我穿了...我戴着护目镜呢 - 你可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, and then you slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 万一你滑倒... - 我确实滑了一跤
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I didn't slip. - What's the weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这什么天气?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:29.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, but anyway, luckily, that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 但总之 很幸运 我没锯到腿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And why we do it, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为什么...我是说...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}flabbergasted at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很惊讶你们刚刚如何...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How long has this taken to create this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们花了多长时间制造这场混乱?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You are mending, fixing, repairing... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们...你们在修复、修缮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.68,0:23:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- ...a dam... - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.68,0:23:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 维修堤坝... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.88,0:23:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is protecting, holding back water,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.88,0:23:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...而堤坝是用来保护并阻挡水的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and if this goes wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.88,0:23:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which there is a likelihood that it will...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.88,0:23:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在看来有可能会出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.48,0:23:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It didn't. - No offence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.48,0:23:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 无意冒犯... - 确实出了点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Straight down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...就在那边 往东端 查德灵顿唯一...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}down at Eastend, the only part of Chadlington
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:24:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- that actually quite likes you... - Brookend. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:24:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 布鲁克恩德 - ...喜欢你的地区
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...you're gonna flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会被你淹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you haven't notified anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且你没有通知任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a statutory requirement to notify the local authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是法定要求 必须通知当地政府
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got to notify the West Oxfordshire District Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须通知西牛津郡议会
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How do you get on with them? - They're gonna say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你现在跟他们处得怎么样? - 他们会拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they are gonna say no, because they're gonna say:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会拒绝 因为他们会说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.00,0:24:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"What precautions have you taken to stop a flood risk?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.00,0:24:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你采取了哪些 预防洪水威胁的措施?”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}None!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一点都没
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.48,0:24:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've still got a chainsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.48,0:24:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还拿着电锯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you knew how to use it right, you'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你知道怎么用就没事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a good job I've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 还好我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm not speaking to him again. Stupid man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我再也不跟他说话了 - 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, and the other thing. Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还有一件事 - 那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.68,0:24:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, no. How are we going to rectify this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我们怎么收拾这个烂摊子?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What mess? - This!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么烂摊子? - 这个!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.80,0:24:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, you've chucked all the... I mean how are you going to get that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.80,0:24:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 你已经把所有东西扔进去了... 你怎么拿出来?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've just dumped rubbish in a water course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你刚把垃圾倒进了水道里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.92,0:24:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is that? Any asbestos in there? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.92,0:24:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你...那是什么? - 下层土
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 里面有石棉吗? - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, that's brick rubble. - That was already in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那块砖...碎石? - 是黏土管
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're blocking the...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那已经在里面了 - 你堵住了...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:24:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't shout at me. No, it's both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:24:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别吼我 吼他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, it's not me! Well, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是他的主意 与我无关! - 不 是你们俩的 你在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You got the digger in. I get employed by him to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你有挖掘机... - 因为是他雇我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.76,0:25:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're aiding and abetting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.76,0:25:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你在帮助并教唆他 - 我什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.16,0:25:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't do anything. - He's farm manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.16,0:25:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是农场经理
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.16,0:25:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here it goes, the blame goes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.16,0:25:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始了 这下成了我的错了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hold on, who was driving it? You were.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 是谁开的车?是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But Charlie, I said: "I don't think this is a good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 查理 我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.48,0:25:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to bring this down here." It wasn't a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.48,0:25:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我觉得把车开到这里 不是个好主意”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}的确不是 这不是个好主意...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We decided, after all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经历了这一切后 我们决定 等地面没那么泥泞了再继续
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.16,0:25:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to stop dam work until the ground was less muddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and went back to installing the new fully insulated pigloos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我们就回去安装全封闭的新猪窝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when that was done,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当完工时 是时候让新居民搬进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was time to move in the new residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.36,0:25:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, let's get them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.36,0:25:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 让我们把它们带回来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that--?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's quite loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不! - 叫得声音好大
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.04,0:25:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on pigs. Come on piggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.04,0:25:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来 猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go, go, go. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 走 - 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.72,0:26:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.72,0:26:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪猪们!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.16,0:26:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this, a whole pig city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.16,0:26:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这里 一座猪猪城
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Woodland pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}林地猪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey boys, look they're snuffling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看啊 它们正在嗅来嗅去的 - 它们已经开始找松露了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have they started truffling? Yes, look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 你看 它们都...看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at their little faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看它们的小脸蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They look happier here than they did in their...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 它们似乎比在田里时开心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.44,0:26:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I feel here happier looking at them. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.44,0:26:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在这里看着它们 我也更开心 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.40,0:26:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the pigs settling into their new woodland home,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.40,0:26:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着猪猪们在林地小屋安家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb could have their old field back,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布可以收回他的地了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.24,0:26:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so he could use it to make money for his side of the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.24,0:26:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样他就能拿那块地 替他那边的运营赚钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.12,0:26:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna clear this up, and then, I'm gonna plant grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.12,0:26:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会清理这块地 然后种草
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - I'm gonna plant grass, make hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 我要在这里种草
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.60,0:26:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, hay. - Sell the hay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.60,0:26:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好制作干草 弄点干草 没错 - 干草
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.76,0:26:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is hay really a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.76,0:26:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干草真的是个好主意吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.00,0:26:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.00,0:26:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.96,0:27:01.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three cuts, get £200 a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.96,0:27:01.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收割三次 每吨能赚两百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.16,0:27:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm going to small bale it, then I'm gonna sell them for £7 a bale.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.16,0:27:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我打算把干草打包成小包 然后以每包七英镑的价格出售
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.84,0:27:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To all the people moving out of London
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.84,0:27:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卖给所有搬出伦敦后养了马的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.28,0:27:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- who then get horses. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.28,0:27:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So who's moved up? Joe Wicks has moved up here apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁搬到...乔威克斯搬到了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道那是谁 - 另一位...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You could introduce me to them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以把我介绍给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.60,0:27:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that for a business plan. Made me happier already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.60,0:27:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这个商业计划 已经让我很开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.56,0:27:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but what the ladies and gentlemen are doing now
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.56,0:27:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 但女士们和先生们 在听到我说我认识
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is shitting themselves laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}乔威克斯时都笑得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- at the notion that I know Joe Wicks. - I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 但我不知道... - 他是新冠期间的健身达人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.40,0:27:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's that fitness man in Covid, and he did those exercises online,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.40,0:27:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他在网上锻炼 大家都开始看他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.04,0:27:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and everybody started watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, he's moved up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 他搬过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got Cowell, we've got Beckham,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有考威尔、贝克汉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.32,0:27:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Natalie Imbruglia...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.32,0:27:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}娜塔莉安博莉亚和阿曼达霍顿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.32,0:27:38.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got Amanda Holden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.84,0:27:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can sell hay to their horses. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.84,0:27:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以把干草卖给他们的马
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 相信我 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.20,0:27:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leaving Kaleb to prep his field,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.20,0:27:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我让卡莱布去准备他的地
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I turned my attention back to the enforcement notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我把注意力转向了强制执行通知书
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie had now submitted our appeal,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}关门通知
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.68,0:27:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理现在已经提交了我们的申诉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I had my fingers crossed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.04,0:27:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that the farm shop at least could stay open,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.04,0:27:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至少能保留农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.64,0:28:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as it was the only way that my "farming the unfarmed" projects
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.64,0:28:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那是我的“开发未耕地”计划中
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.44,0:28:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场 黑莓果酱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}could ever make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唯一的赚钱方式
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.72,0:28:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm actually £8,230 up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.72,0:28:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我实际上赚了8230英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.52,0:28:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To make sure we had a case,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.52,0:28:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了确保我们有理有据 必须保证商店“干干净净”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the shop had to be squeaky clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which meant everything for sale in there
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着店里出售的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had to have come from inside a council-imposed 16-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个跟我蛋蛋的味道一样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.64,0:28:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都必须来自议会规定的 方圆25公里以内的地区
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We all understood that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场的鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们都理解这一要求
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Except Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.80,0:28:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa has a rather Irish attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.80,0:28:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎对规章制度 有一种爱尔兰人的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.52,0:28:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to rules and regulations. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.52,0:28:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went in there the other day whilst it was closed, after hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天关门后 我去了商店
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.36,0:28:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Under the counter...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.36,0:28:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}私底下 应有尽有
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.44,0:28:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}red-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.44,0:28:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}被我当场逮到
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you want any of the products you and I have put a moratorium on selling--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你想购买任何 我们已经停止销售的产品...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No because we keep saying to her: "You can't sell this."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 因为我们一直跟她说 “你不能卖这个 你不能...”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.44,0:28:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she literally can't see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.44,0:28:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她不能...她是真的不理解原因
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So here is a planning enforcement notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 这是规划强制执行通知书
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"If you don't comply, you get prosecuted."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你不遵守就会被起诉 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.96,0:28:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not like a civil thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.96,0:29:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不是民事诉讼 我一直跟丽莎说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.56,0:29:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I keep saying to Lisa:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.12,0:29:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"If you carry on selling stuff that is in breach of this enforcement notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.12,0:29:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“如果你继续出售违反
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.84,0:29:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“强制执行通知书的东西...” - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.96,0:29:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"we--" Well, it'll be me in The Daily Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.96,0:29:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“...我们... 上《每日邮报》的人会是我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.56,0:29:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But "we will be fined."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.56,0:29:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“但我们会被罚款”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.32,0:29:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I-- So, if you could have a st-- I mean, I talked to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.32,0:29:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我...所以你可以...我跟她聊过
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.36,0:29:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, it'll be all right."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.36,0:29:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说:“不会有事的”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is lovely. I mean I'd love to live in Ireland
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很可爱 我很想住在爱尔兰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.52,0:29:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause I think a country functions better
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.52,0:29:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得如果一个国家有这种态度
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.16,0:29:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- if you have that attitude. - So, you'd like me to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.16,0:29:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 运作会更加高效 只要... - 所以你想让我说...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.96,0:29:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know sometimes you're quite firm with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.96,0:29:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道你有时对我挺严厉的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.32,0:29:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Could you be that firm with Lisa and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.32,0:29:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能严厉地对丽莎说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Lisa, you have got to take out all this illegal stuff"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“丽莎 你得撤掉这些违法的东西”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.28,0:29:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.44,0:29:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.44,0:29:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 查理 - 我们受到了当局关注
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're under the spotlight. Properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.64,0:29:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.64,0:29:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.76,0:29:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Quite a lot of it is directed at the farm shop as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.76,0:29:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中很多是针对农场商店的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I know we've had discussions over the past few months
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道我们在过去几个月里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.96,0:29:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about what you can and can't sell,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.96,0:29:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经讨论过 可以以及不可以售卖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we've done the potato thing, which has gone brilliantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 我们已经完成了土豆那部分
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.28,0:30:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, it has. Everyone loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.28,0:30:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一切进展顺利 - 是的 大家都很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, but you've got prices now on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但你现在把价格贴在... - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.52,0:30:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.48,0:30:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't do that. Really you can't sell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.48,0:30:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不能那么做 我们...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的 你不能卖那些衣服 - 当然了 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You cannot sell them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你不能卖衣服 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't give them any more ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不能再让他们抓到把柄了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 任何东西 任何产自方圆25公里外的东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- anything that is 16 miles away must go. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - ...都必须撤掉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean as much as I want to respect
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然我想尽可能尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.04,0:30:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}government, councils and everything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.04,0:30:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府、议会以及其他一切...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at what stage
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - ...但在某个阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}do you just really struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不觉得真的很难尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.76,0:30:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with trying to respect what they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.76,0:30:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们的所作所为吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.52,0:30:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because there could be-- I'm not trading arms here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.52,0:30:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为可能有...我这儿又不是交易武器
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.36,0:30:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just a farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.36,0:30:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这只是一家农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.44,0:30:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll come back to that. Where's the Monopoly from?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.44,0:30:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会回到这个话题的 《大富翁》是哪儿来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cotswolds Monopoly. Look, Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}科茨沃尔德的《大富翁》
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.04,0:30:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah I know, but it's made in...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.04,0:30:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 这...我知道 但这是中国制造的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- China... It's like the book Jeremy wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就像杰里米写的书一样 - 对 但你不能在这里卖书
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.68,0:30:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't sell the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't sell the book here. I mean, we have to follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《迪丽斯库阿特 农场的一年》
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.84,0:30:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须遵守规则
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we don't follow the rules, you could actually end up
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们不遵守
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.04,0:30:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with a criminal conviction, which is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.04,0:30:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可能真的会被判有罪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很荒谬 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.20,0:31:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because all we're doing is selling some amazing farm produce,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.20,0:31:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们只是在卖 很不错的农产品而已
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.96,0:31:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, oils, chutneys,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.96,0:31:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}油、辣椒酱、橘子酱...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}marm... marmala...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.72,0:31:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We don't even grow oranges.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.72,0:31:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们甚至都没种橘子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's old stock from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是去年的存货...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but it doesn't matter whether it's old stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 但是不是存货并没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.44,0:31:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They would prefer that I waste it. - Where is it made?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.44,0:31:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们宁愿我浪费... - 它的产地是哪儿?南萨默塞特
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.92,0:31:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}South Somerset.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's not within our 16 miles. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那在25公里以外 不在方圆25公里以内
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.12,0:31:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The longer I look, the worse it becomes, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.12,0:31:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不在 我看得越久 情况越糟 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.84,0:31:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Handkerchiefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.84,0:31:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}手帕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.88,0:31:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They look quite Italian to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.88,0:31:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这手帕看起来很像意大利货
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.28,0:31:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Were they embroidered locally?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.28,0:31:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是当地绣的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 丽莎 我们真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lisa, we've really... - Charlie, I understand. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我...查理 我理解
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.28,0:31:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just I find it really difficult that everything we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.28,0:31:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是...我觉得真的很难接受 我们所做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:48.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it doesn't make any difference. It's still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}根本没任何用 依然被说不行
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.36,0:31:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we are fighting, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.36,0:31:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们在与那些不理性
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}people who are not being rational about the objective, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}且不了解这个农场的目标 和位置的人抗争
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.60,0:31:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}position of this farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.12,0:31:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All we're wanting to do is sell some local produce,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.12,0:31:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只想售卖当地的产品
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.52,0:32:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is what we're allowed to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.52,0:32:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我们有许可 能在商店里卖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.16,0:32:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from a shop that we have permission in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:06.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When we challenge them, which we are doing on the planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:06.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我们按照计划质疑他们时
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.32,0:32:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we can then say: "This is ridiculous. Let's get a carpark in."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.32,0:32:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们才可以说:“这太荒谬了 让我们建个停车场”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.04,0:32:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know it's frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.04,0:32:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道这让人很沮丧 生活中的很多规则都令人沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lots of rules in life are frustrating,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but these we must follow just for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们暂时必须遵守
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.92,0:32:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, in no particular order:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.92,0:32:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}顺序不分先后:橘子酱、书 大概还有袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.96,0:32:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}marmalade, book,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.16,0:32:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}presumably socks--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Monopoly, handkerchiefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《大富翁》、手帕...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.68,0:32:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you manage to get across to her
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.68,0:32:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你跟她讲清楚了 不能随便卖货的重要性...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.40,0:32:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- the importance of not selling... - I did see produce
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.40,0:32:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的...在我离开前 我确实看到产品被运出商店
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.72,0:32:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}coming out of the shop before I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.36,0:32:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Books particularly, Monopoly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.36,0:32:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}特别是书、《大富翁》
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there's the, I, ye-- Yes, I think actually she--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以有...对 我觉得... 我觉得我们跟她讲清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we've got the message through.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, she's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 她现在不在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.28,0:32:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll bet you any money
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.28,0:32:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我打赌她正在把今早拿出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.64,0:32:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}she's loading her car up with all the stuff she took out this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.64,0:32:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有东西装上她的车 准备放回去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.52,0:32:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and is putting it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.28,0:32:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.88,0:33:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Praying that Charlie had got through to Lisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.88,0:33:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我祈祷查理成功说服了丽莎 与此同时 我回去完成冬季工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.60,0:33:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I got back to my winter jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which alternated between tedious...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些工作时而单调乏味...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.16,0:33:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.24,0:33:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Delicious snack for you "sheeps".
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.24,0:33:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是给你们绵羊的美味小吃
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.00,0:33:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh for fuck sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.00,0:33:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And unbelievably rewarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...时而带有难以置信的回报
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}切碎中
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.84,0:33:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Minced.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.84,0:33:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}切碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.96,0:33:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.96,0:33:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除此以外 我认为 还有一个冬季工作值得完成
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.08,0:33:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there was another winter task that I'd decided was worth doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.12,0:33:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My job today is to try and save the life of this willow tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.12,0:33:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我今天的工作是 试着拯救这棵柳树的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.12,0:33:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which amazingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.12,0:33:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}令人惊讶的是 虽然树倒了 但它并没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.92,0:33:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}even though it's fallen over,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.64,0:33:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}isn't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Obviously, to do this, I needed some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 要做到这一点 我需要一些帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.40,0:34:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I called Rupert, the local tree expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.40,0:34:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我给当地的树木专家 鲁珀特打了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.16,0:34:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the plan then, to make it come back up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.16,0:34:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算怎么让它复位呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're going to pollard it right low.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得给它去梢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're going to take off all the weight at the top of the willow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得把柳树顶端的重量都去掉 所以希望...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.16,0:34:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's pollarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.16,0:34:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是去梢? - 是去梢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.36,0:34:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's pollarding. It's going to maintain the tree, make it last longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.36,0:34:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这能维护树木 让它活得更久
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.44,0:34:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 18 years or so. - But there's no roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.44,0:34:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 十五年左右 - 但我...什么?没有根?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How's it going to put roots down?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它怎么扎根呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.40,0:34:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.40,0:34:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 根会长回来的 - 会吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.56,0:34:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will they? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.56,0:34:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.36,0:34:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After Rupert had used his hydraulic secateurs
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.36,0:34:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鲁珀特用他的液压剪枝器
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.68,0:34:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to prune the tree of excess weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.68,0:34:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}修剪掉多余的重量后...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.56,0:34:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody glad I'm not in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.56,0:34:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真开心不用我去操作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We joined forces, like the Cotswold Thunderbirds,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我们像科茨沃尔德雷鸟队一样合作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.56,0:35:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with me in a rented Bobcat
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.56,0:35:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我驾驶租来的山猫机器 拉着连接在树上的缆绳
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.12,0:35:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}pulling a cable attached to the tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and Rupert using his JCB
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而鲁珀特用他的JCB 提供额外的杠杆力
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to provide extra leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we can get this tree upright, it'll be a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们能让这棵树直立起来 那就是一个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.28,0:35:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we get it upright, and it survives...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.28,0:35:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们让它立起来并活下去...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was gonna say I'll go to church.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来想说我会去教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.80,0:35:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay Jeremy, if you can drive forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.80,0:35:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 杰里米 你往前开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全力前进
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.16,0:35:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm guessing from the wheelspin
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.16,0:36:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我猜从车轮的旋转来看 我们无法把树立起来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we're not making the tree become vertical.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.60,0:36:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just waiting for the cable to snap and scythe through the cab,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.60,0:36:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只能等着缆绳断掉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.80,0:36:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}severing my abdomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.80,0:36:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后让镰刀穿过驾驶室 切断我的腹部
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.56,0:36:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the willow still stubbornly horizontal,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.56,0:36:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着柳树仍然固执地躺在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.96,0:36:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to deploy my chainsaw skills
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.96,0:36:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定对其余下的树枝 施展我的电锯技能
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.16,0:36:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on its remaining branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.64,0:36:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then Rupert tried to pull the tree up on his lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.64,0:36:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后鲁珀特试着独自将树拉起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here he comes! Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.48,0:36:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.48,0:36:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}立起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.96,0:36:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it going to fall straight over again? Is it going to go upright, or?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.96,0:36:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}难道又要直接倒下了吗? 它能直立吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.48,0:36:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tree is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.48,0:36:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}树立起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's just brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.20,0:37:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Really well thanks for that. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.20,0:37:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很棒 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And honestly you'd never know we'd had a digger in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老实说 你根本不会察觉 我们在这里使用了挖掘机或其他机器
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or any machinery at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Please, God, don't let Charlie Ireland down here
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上帝啊 让查理爱尔兰 六个月内都别来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for at least 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.12,0:37:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}February was now upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.12,0:37:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}二月即将来临
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.44,0:37:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And with the pigs enjoying their new woodland home,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.44,0:37:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在猪猪们享受它们的林地新家园时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.64,0:37:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and my winter jobs mainly done,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.64,0:37:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的冬季工作基本完成
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.64,0:37:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went off to do some filming for The Grand Tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.64,0:37:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去拍了几集《大世界之旅》
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And while I was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不在的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}one of the pointy-eared mongrel piglets fell ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一只尖耳杂种小猪崽生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.12,0:38:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So Lisa called in Dilwyn the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.12,0:37:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.96,0:38:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎请来了兽医迪尔翁
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.44,0:38:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, he's got blue ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.44,0:38:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的耳朵是蓝色的 有点发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.64,0:38:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He's been shivering a bit. Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's a bit unsteady on his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}腿有点站不稳
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You can see his belly's quite empty. Why--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到它的肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think he's been suckling his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很空 所以它没有喝它妈妈的奶
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the blue ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这...蓝耳朵是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The blue ears is he's probably got a bit of septicaemia,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蓝耳朵表明它可能得了败血症
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is basically, he's in shock a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上 它有一点休克的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because he's probably
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它...它的血液里 可能有一只漂浮的虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.36,0:38:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}got a bug floating around in his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.56,0:38:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll take him back. I'll put the heater on in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.56,0:38:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会带它回去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - And I'll take him back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会把车里的暖气打开... - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.76,0:38:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I'll keep you posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.76,0:38:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我会带它回来的 有情况我们会及时通知你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.52,0:38:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Poor little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.52,0:38:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 小可怜 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.16,0:38:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa then insisted that Dilwyn give the piglet
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.16,0:38:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后丽莎坚持让迪尔翁给小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.08,0:38:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the full 5-star platinum plus treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.08,0:38:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}布里奇兽医诊所
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.56,0:38:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做完整的五星级铂金治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's the pump, and that warms up the fluids going into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 这是泵
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.04,0:38:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个会把液体加热后输送到它的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.16,0:38:53.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So basically, we're trying to warm up his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.16,0:38:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们正在努力让它的... 温暖它的血液
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.68,0:38:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're warming up his body
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.68,0:38:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在加热它体内的血液
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.44,0:38:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and this is trying to correct his dehydration really.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.44,0:38:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后...这是试着改善它的脱水情况
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.32,0:39:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, we'll see how we get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.32,0:39:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我们看看情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.04,0:39:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I returned a week later
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.04,0:39:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一周后我回来了 我直接投入到养猪的工作中
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.80,0:39:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and got straight back into more pig jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.80,0:39:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.80,0:39:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.36,0:39:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Home time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.36,0:39:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回家时间
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.36,0:39:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The first of which was to return Ajax,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.36,0:39:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一个工作就是返还阿贾克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the boar I'd rented to impregnate the lady pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那头让猪女士们怀孕的公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.28,0:39:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, he must be so looking forward to going back to some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.28,0:39:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它一定很想回到朋友的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.64,0:39:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how much it cost, how much we had to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.64,0:39:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道它多少钱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.56,0:39:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要付多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.68,0:39:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For each successful shag he had is 50 quid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.68,0:39:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它每成功交配一次要支付 50 英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.88,0:39:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have to pay his pimp at Avis,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.88,0:39:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得给他的皮条客阿维斯付钱 我们从他那里租的...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.28,0:39:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- from whom we rented him, 50 quid. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.28,0:39:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - ...50英镑 它成功了五次?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.56,0:39:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And so he's done... five?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.44,0:39:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Four. Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.44,0:39:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 四次 - 四次
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's 80 quid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是80英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.56,0:39:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.56,0:39:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 是200英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.52,0:39:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we're on the subject of money, Lisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.52,0:39:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说起钱 丽莎 我不在的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.88,0:39:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- you know when I was away... Hmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.44,0:39:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- ...and that piglet was ill. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.44,0:39:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只小猪崽生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.40,0:39:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:39:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And you sent it to the vet. - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:39:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你把它送去兽医那儿了 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.64,0:40:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the vet bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.64,0:40:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是兽医的账单
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.84,0:40:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God almighty! And it died.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.84,0:40:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷啊 也太贵了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.44,0:40:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Feeder tube. Aw colostomy! They put a feeding tube down his--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.44,0:40:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}喂食管、初乳... 他们不得不插入喂食管...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.60,0:40:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no. Never mind what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.60,0:40:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 不 别管他们做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.04,0:40:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that say? £673.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.04,0:40:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是多少钱?673英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.32,0:40:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just let them die? - Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.32,0:40:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没了 - 我就放任它们死去?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.92,0:40:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what you do actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.92,0:40:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我其实不知道你会做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.32,0:40:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put that one down when it was like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.32,0:40:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当它处于那种状态时 就放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.68,0:40:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Say goodbye. I didn't know, everyone was away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.68,0:40:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 跟它告别 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-£673.40. They tried to keep it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 大家都不在 所以我就... - 673.4英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.56,0:40:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, they did!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.56,0:40:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们真的尽力让它活下去 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A post-mortem? That's a bit flash. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:32.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尸体解剖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.12,0:40:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 你... - 这很贵
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.56,0:40:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Who asked for a post-mortem? - Have you got that picture of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.56,0:40:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谁要求的? - 你有那张照片吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.36,0:40:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So here's one picture look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.36,0:40:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这儿有一张照片 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's at the vet nurse's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是兽医护士家
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause they had to take it home for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他们必须带它回去过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.88,0:40:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.84,0:40:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But she was getting paid all night to look after that pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.84,0:40:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但她整晚照看那头猪是有钱拿的 她...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.80,0:40:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the little thing on his ear like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.80,0:40:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看小家伙的耳朵...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.64,0:40:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're farmers! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.64,0:40:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它看起来很...我知道 - 我们是农民
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I mean I like the piglets, but £673! - I'll eat it myself in future.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我喜欢小猪崽 但673英镑 - 以后我会自己吃...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's bad. That's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那太糟了 这...太贵了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.64,0:40:58.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, now they've done a post-mortem, why did it die?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.64,0:40:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}既然做了尸检 那知道它为什么会死吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.96,0:41:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gonna bring that gate around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It had a heart defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有心脏缺陷
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, who was to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 谁能想到呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.44,0:41:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we do now,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.44,0:41:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在知道了 因为我们花了673英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.52,0:41:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- because we've spent £673. Go on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.52,0:41:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.60,0:41:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cock!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.52,0:41:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You go that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.52,0:41:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到外面去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.60,0:41:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The extravagance was all the more annoying,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.60,0:41:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这种奢侈令人愈发恼火
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.04,0:41:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it was now time to see how Kaleb and I were doing
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.04,0:41:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为现在是时候 看卡莱布和我在比赛中的表现了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.88,0:41:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in our competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.64,0:41:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've got to add another 1,800 quid to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.64,0:41:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们还得加上一千八百英镑 - 一千九
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.00,0:41:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb was still massively in the red,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.00,0:41:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布仍然严重亏损
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.28,0:41:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but now the pigs were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.28,0:41:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在养了猪 我的支出也在增加
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}my outgoings were also on the rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.28,0:41:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're at £98,500
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.28,0:41:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你到目前花了98500英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.84,0:41:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you've spent so far
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.64,0:41:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and made nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.64,0:41:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一分钱都没赚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.84,0:41:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't you worry about me. Let's worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.84,0:41:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别担心我 担心一下你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That pig. Oh, we've got the pig bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那只猪... - 我们收到了猪的账单
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£673.40. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 673.4英镑 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.08,0:41:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa has screwed me on this one, I'll grant you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.08,0:41:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎给我搞砸了 我得承认
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.92,0:41:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Another one coming. - Another one what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.92,0:41:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 又来了一个账单 - 什么账单?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.20,0:41:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got loads more. I've got loads of bills here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.20,0:41:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我这儿有很多账单给你 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.36,0:41:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - That machine that you're obsessed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.36,0:41:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你租的那台你很着迷的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.32,0:42:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is my emotional support machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.32,0:42:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我的情感支持机器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.84,0:42:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}like an emotional support dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.84,0:42:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像情感支持犬一样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.76,0:42:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm going to take it on planes with me on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.76,0:42:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会把它带上飞机 跟我一起度假
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.88,0:42:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It can have its own seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.88,0:42:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会有自己的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how much was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.44,0:42:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£1,050.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.44,0:42:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}1050英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.28,0:42:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I think that can be cancelled out by how happy it makes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.28,0:42:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我觉得这价格可以 与它让我高兴的程度相抵消
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.88,0:42:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it definitely cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.88,0:42:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 当然不行
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, does it-- Does it keep me out of your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧...它是不是... 它是不是让我不再让你烦心了?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.32,0:42:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it did, I like the machine, don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.32,0:42:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我喜欢这台机器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.76,0:42:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 'Cause you're nowhere near me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.76,0:42:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别误会我的意思 只是单纯因为你不在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.48,0:42:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.40,0:42:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you have someone come down with a digger,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.40,0:42:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你找人过来用了挖掘机吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and remove a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去...移除了一棵树 那...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.12,0:42:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, we put a tree back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.12,0:42:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 我们让一棵树复位了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.60,0:42:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okey dokey. Well, that is a total of £3,090.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.60,0:42:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 那总共是3090英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.60,0:42:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just there if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.60,0:42:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我是你 我会写在那里 加上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.00,0:42:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Put it there. -£3,090?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.00,0:42:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 3090英镑?你还有什么? - 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.96,0:42:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What else have you got? There's the pig food.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.96,0:42:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪食的账单
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.44,0:42:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£2,952.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.44,0:42:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪食
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.32,0:42:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}2952英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.88,0:42:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have they been going to the Savoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.88,0:42:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是去萨沃伊豪华酒店了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then you had the hire of the boar. - Oh, stop saying things. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你不得不租那头公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.48,0:42:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别再说了 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.32,0:42:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The hire of the boar. £200. Boar hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.32,0:42:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 租用公猪 200英镑 - 公猪租赁
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.16,0:43:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This mountain of bills meant that my profits of £413
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.16,0:42:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}机械租赁4140 猪食2952 公猪租赁200
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:43:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}减去这堆积如山的账单后 我原本的利润由413 英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.92,0:43:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had been turned into a loss of nearly £8,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.92,0:43:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}变成了亏损将近8000英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.84,0:43:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on, pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.84,0:43:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续走 猪猪!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.48,0:43:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, in a bittersweet way,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.48,0:43:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 苦乐参半的是
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.48,0:43:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was about to start seeing a return on my investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.48,0:43:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始看到投资的回报了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.76,0:43:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.76,0:43:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.80,0:43:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As it was time to take the first batch of pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.80,0:43:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...是时候将第一批猪送到屠宰场了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.08,0:43:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to the slaughterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.92,0:43:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're in for an exciting car ride. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.92,0:43:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来享受激动人心的旅程吧 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.12,0:43:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, since the abattoir was more than 40 miles away
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.12,0:43:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 屠宰场在60公里外的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.96,0:43:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I didn't have a licence to transport them that far,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.96,0:43:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我没有执照 将它们运到那么远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.00,0:43:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the government's pig police said I must be accompanied by Michaela,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.00,0:43:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府的养猪警察
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.80,0:43:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a local breeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.80,0:43:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说必须让当地饲养员米凯拉陪我去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.48,0:43:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, I've got guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.48,0:43:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好了 我有种负罪感
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.24,0:43:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You should feel sad when they go to the abattoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.24,0:43:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们拉去屠宰场时 你应该感到悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.76,0:43:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It means you've cared about your animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.76,0:43:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那意味着你在乎自己养的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.40,0:43:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I do care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.40,0:43:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我确实在乎它们 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.96,0:43:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got to eat them to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.96,0:43:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须吃掉它们才能拯救其性命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.28,0:44:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That enables the survival of the breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.28,0:44:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那让这种物种得以繁衍
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.16,0:44:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't keep them all alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.16,0:44:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不能让它们都活着
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.04,0:44:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's what I've always said about pandas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.04,0:44:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就是一直这么说熊猫的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.76,0:44:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you want to save the giant panda, start eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.76,0:44:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你想拯救大熊猫 那就开始吃大熊猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.96,0:44:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know for every middle white pig in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.96,0:44:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知不知道 中白猪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.96,0:44:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there are 3 giant pandas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.96,0:44:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟大熊猫的数量比是一比三?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.60,0:44:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Middle white pork, you can't beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.60,0:44:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中白猪 无与伦比
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's better than sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比做爱还好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.64,0:44:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.64,0:44:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.52,0:44:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With anyone, even Ewan McGregor, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.52,0:44:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比跟任何人做爱都好 哪怕是伊万麦克格雷戈
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.48,0:44:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not sure Ewan's going to be very pleased to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.48,0:44:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不太确定伊万听到这话是否会高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.08,0:44:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}优质屠夫和屠宰场
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, okey dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的?好的 总共是七头?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.84,0:44:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven, all seven there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.28,0:44:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. Righty-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.28,0:44:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.56,0:44:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, out you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.56,0:44:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走吧 出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.64,0:44:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've really enjoyed keeping pigs. They've not escaped once.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.64,0:44:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很喜欢养猪 它们一次都没逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.56,0:44:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you like pigs? I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.56,0:44:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你喜欢猪? - 我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.68,0:45:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on then, pigs. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.68,0:45:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续走 猪猪 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.32,0:45:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're nice pigs actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.32,0:45:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们真的是好猪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These stronger ones you'll be having for bacon and sausages I'd have thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些更强壮的 我觉得你可以拿来做培根和香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.16,0:45:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm assuming you want everything--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.16,0:45:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我猜你想要一切... 你的屠夫也会想要一切的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.68,0:45:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The butcher will want everything back,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bar the squeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一点都不浪费
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.20,0:45:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, don't. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.20,0:45:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 别 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.04,0:45:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every time I go to an abattoir...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.04,0:45:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次前往屠宰场 都觉得非常残忍
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.32,0:45:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}your cruel abattoir humour.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.48,0:45:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bye, pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.48,0:45:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再见了 猪猪们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.52,0:45:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As usual, I was sad as I drove away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.52,0:45:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}同往常一样 我悲伤地驾车离开
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.92,0:45:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But this time, at least, I'd behaved more like a farmer
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.92,0:45:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这次 至少 我表现得更像农民了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.24,0:45:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and not had any unmanly moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.24,0:45:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直维持着男子汉气概
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, that was all about to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 这一切即将改变
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.12,0:45:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because an avalanche of heartache
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.12,0:45:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为一次令人难以承受的心痛 即将向我袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.80,0:45:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was heading my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.16,0:45:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下集预告
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh my God, they're so far up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 它们太深了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.76,0:46:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of them is as weak as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.76,0:46:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一只太虚弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.44,0:46:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is why you're losing so many piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.44,0:46:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是你失去了那么多小猪崽的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.68,0:46:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译: 匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.68,0:46:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 杨婕
